                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "1413a1c2-9bad-4290-8cea-9e4eb3572ca4",
                        "entry_id": "1fec8e98-d4fa-3bb0-a0ec-1484031d45b4",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "pergole"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "df31fc7a-cc35-3498-8231-6512ad1fd26b",
                        "entry_id": "1fec8e98-d4fa-3bb0-a0ec-1484031d45b4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Construction généralement en bois, très ajourée, sur laquelle on laisse souvent pousser des plantes grimpantes, des arbustes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Jardinage"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30a5f494-a87f-44af-bb1b-6706f6072766",
                                "sense_id": "df31fc7a-cc35-3498-8231-6512ad1fd26b",
                                "text": "Nous passions nos après-midi d'été à l’ombre de la pergola."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0fe0e3b-b9b4-46b7-a91a-f588ccf4df1a",
                                "sense_id": "df31fc7a-cc35-3498-8231-6512ad1fd26b",
                                "text": "La pergola peut aussi prolonger la façade de la maison (arrière ou avant) et constituer un cadre architecturé pour la terrasse."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "97ccc691-9529-4469-b53d-6faaa1fc9392",
                        "source_entry_id": "1fec8e98-d4fa-3bb0-a0ec-1484031d45b4",
                        "source_sense_id": "df31fc7a-cc35-3498-8231-6512ad1fd26b",
                        "target_lang_word": "pergola",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pergola",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bfe59da-a09b-305d-bdf5-c9e6bca1d52d",
                                        "entry_id": "a52a70b4-2565-3922-89f0-7c67846b710f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A framework in the form of a passageway of columns that supports a trelliswork roof; used to support and train climbing plants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "933ae368-fbcf-498b-a087-85322933a9bd",
                                                "sense_id": "5bfe59da-a09b-305d-bdf5-c9e6bca1d52d",
                                                "text": "The thick vegetation met overhead, interlacing into a natural pergola, and through this tunnel of verdure in a golden twilight flowed the green, pellucid river, beautiful in itself, but marvelous from the strange tints thrown by the vivid light from above filtered and tempered in its fall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ddb0a68-5505-4996-a673-0a6f92157906",
                                                "sense_id": "5bfe59da-a09b-305d-bdf5-c9e6bca1d52d",
                                                "text": "By the little garden pergola open to the winds some fluttered peacocks were blotted nervelessly amid the dripping trees, their heads sunk back beneath their wings: while in the pergola itself, like a fallen storm-cloud, lolled a negress, her levelled, polecat eyes semi-veiled by the nebulous alchemy of the rainbow."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfc4f04f-4280-44f0-aed1-46f70baf3db6",
                                                "sense_id": "5bfe59da-a09b-305d-bdf5-c9e6bca1d52d",
                                                "text": "While both pergolas and arbors are most dramatic cloaked in climbing, flowing plants, only a pergola will stand naked as a piece of architecture."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e65fb97-6028-46e1-a78d-2a0d1a407a56",
                                                "sense_id": "5bfe59da-a09b-305d-bdf5-c9e6bca1d52d",
                                                "text": "When I first saw the movie, Chocolat, my favorite element wasn't the plot or the character development or even the cinematography. It was the cloth-draped pergola under which a very special birthday dinner was served."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fee03acd-444b-34aa-b38e-db1f600bb098",
                                        "entry_id": "a52a70b4-2565-3922-89f0-7c67846b710f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Such a framework employed to provide shade, especially over a patio."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d19c5147-2e9e-4293-945c-def578eb6058",
                        "source_entry_id": "1fec8e98-d4fa-3bb0-a0ec-1484031d45b4",
